# Morrowind Temple: Tuls Valen's "Pilgrimage to Maar Gan" (TT_MaarGan). The rock in the Maar Gan shrine tells of
# Vivec taunting Mehrunes Dagon (shrineMaarGan: 20, the "taunt the Daedra" topic). Four taunts make the Dremora at
# the shrine attack (30); praying at the rock again blesses the player (60). Tuls Valen hears of it (100, a Block
# book).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel; god mode takes the Dremora's attack. Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's
# slot 05: 057464E4 the rock.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_falseincarnate_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_maargan_start
talk tuls valen
ask duties
ask Maar Gan
expect GetJournalIndex TT_MaarGan == 10
bye
end

case tt_maargan_shrine
run
player->PositionCell -2177 1250 970 0 "Maar Gan, Shrine"
until 600 "dremora_ttmg"->GetDistance player < 1500
wait 120
activate 057464E4
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_MaarGan == 20
talk dremora_ttmg
ask taunt the Daedra
ask taunt the Daedra
ask taunt the Daedra
ask taunt the Daedra
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_MaarGan == 30
wait 60
activate 057464E4
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_MaarGan == 60
end

case tt_maargan_done
run
player->PositionCell 3637 3900 14723 0 "Ald-ruhn, Temple"
until 600 "tuls valen"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tuls valen
ask Maar Gan
expect GetJournalIndex TT_MaarGan == 100
bye
end
